\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   Jesus Christ, we come to you
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 with this little child before you.
\par You gave us command yourself
\par that we bring to you our children,
\par and you deliver them from sin
\par and into thy Heavenly Kingdom.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Thy word also tell us that;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 If man is not a born again
\par By water and the spirit
\par He inherits not your Kingdom
\par And you don't want us in this flesh
\par But by spirit we shall be there.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. By this we have come to you;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 come for him from us, he is yours
\par show your shining face to us
\par on the soul of this little child,
\par that He may be yours on this earth
\par and in future in your heavens.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Jesus, take thy precious blood
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 cleanse him from all evil spirit.
\par We, can only baptize him
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0      you will shower blessings on him
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 our inheritance is our sins
\par Everlasting life is your gift.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Let the nature of his birth
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 be so blessed and clean from evil
\par Bless him with this baptism,
\par take away the serpent's poison
\par and if even he's so unclean
\par Let him be washed by this water.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  Take your Lamb, O good Shepherd
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Let him be part of your branches
\par You are the Head of your church
\par take him to be part of your joint
\par You are the way to your father
\par Take him, give him life and good rest.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.  What we have from all our hearts
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 we add them up into your own
\par Let our pray'r comes to be true
\par and do to us all the great things
\par and record this name we give him
\par in your Holy Books in Heaven.
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f1\fs14 
\par \fs14 
\par }

